COM	Minimal mzTab-M 2.1.0 file exercising every 2.1 metadata field and all four tables (profile M+S+F+E).
COM	One LC-MS feature of proline, ambiguously identified as L- or D-proline by spectral library search,
COM	and one unidentified feature with unknown charge. Two samples, two assays, two MS runs, and two study
COM	variables in one ordinal study_variable_group. All values are illustrative.
